<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves fell in May.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves fell in May.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, fell $206 million to $20.216 billion in May, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
